<title>HONG KONG: Trading in FPB Bank shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in FPB Bank shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of FPB Bank Holdings Co Ltd was suspended at the company's request in late morning pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company shares rose HK$0.375 or 9.04 percent to HK$4.525 prior to the trading suspension. Volume was 28.48 million shares worth HK$130.38 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
